window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-168-2b69b52bfeadaa37.json"]={sha256:"2b69b52bfeadaa37d47637bb16f03e2b66bf40450dc453db0bd9d982273f22c3",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-d30e23afc3081aad","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.984.3/en","title":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","titleEn":"ITU-T G.984.3: GPON transmission convergence layer","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-168","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-168","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-169","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en"],"title":"PON 上行突發：近遠端接收動態範圍","titleEn":"PON upstream bursts: near-far receiver dynamic range","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學可配置等化延遲上限180 µs；20 km配置可用，25 km需重新規劃而非任意放寬碰撞判準。 ranging_timeline.csv與補償後到達誤差 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 150 與變更 200 us、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching configurable equalization limit180 µs:20 km works,25 km needs redesign rather than relaxed collision acceptance. ranging_timeline.csv and post-equalization arrival errors Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 150 and changed 200 us, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學可接受動態範圍20 dB且每端絕對功率均合格；21 dB組失敗，16 dB仍需個別端點檢查。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching dynamic-range limit20 dB plus valid absolute endpoints;21 dB fails while16 dB still requires endpoint checks.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成群速度2e8 m/s，近端5 km與遠端20 km；變更遠端25 km，近端不變。 名義式 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us；變更式 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 在共同OLT時間軸列發送、往返及補償量，驗證兩ONU的授權參考時刻一致。","合成最強−8 dBm、最弱−24 dBm；變更最弱−29 dBm，強端保持。 名義式 -8-(-24) = 16 dB；變更式 -8-(-29) = 21 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 轉為mW再取最強/最弱比的10log10；把過載與靈敏度限制各列一條，不能只比差值。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic group velocity2e8 m/s, near ONU5 km and far ONU20 km; change the far route to25 km. Nominal 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us; changed 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Plot transmission, round-trip propagation and equalization on one OLT timeline and verify aligned grant reference times.","Synthetic strongest burst−8 dBm and weakest−24 dBm; change the weakest to−29 dBm. Nominal -8-(-24) = 16 dB; changed -8-(-29) = 21 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Convert to mW and recover10log10 of the power ratio; check overload and sensitivity independently of the range.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-178","referenceUrls":["https://www.bw-digital.com/projects/hawaiki/"],"title":"Hawaiki：維修時間與不可用比例","titleEn":"Hawaiki: repair time and unavailability fraction","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：由另一學徒只使用交付檔案重建兩情境與判定；需同時保留未通過情境。 教學可配置等化延遲上限180 µs；20 km配置可用，25 km需重新規劃而非任意放寬碰撞判準。 ranging_timeline.csv與補償後到達誤差 保留輸入、逐項中間值、名義 150 與變更 200 us、反例、驗收判定與模型限制，供另一學徒從零重算。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: A second apprentice must reconstruct both scenarios and decisions using only the handover files; retain failing cases as well. Teaching configurable equalization limit180 µs:20 km works,25 km needs redesign rather than relaxed collision acceptance. ranging_timeline.csv and post-equalization arrival errors Preserve inputs, intermediate values, nominal 150 and changed 200 us, counterexamples, acceptance decisions and model limits so another apprentice can reproduce them.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學不可用比例上限0.002；10天方案不足、4天方案通過；說明固定平均模型不含尾部與共同災害。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching unavailability limit0.002:10-day repair fails and4-day repair passes; the mean model omits tails and common disasters.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["合成群速度2e8 m/s，近端5 km與遠端20 km；變更遠端25 km，近端不變。 名義式 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us；變更式 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 在共同OLT時間軸列發送、往返及補償量，驗證兩ONU的授權參考時刻一致。","合成平均可用期間3650天，平均維修10天；有備料情境改為4天，均非營運商維修承諾。 名義式 10/(3650+10) = 0.00273224 fraction；變更式 4/(3650+4) = 0.00109469 fraction。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 建立100個完全同長的合成週期，用停機總天數/總天數回算；區別MTBF指可用期間或含維修週期的定義。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Synthetic group velocity2e8 m/s, near ONU5 km and far ONU20 km; change the far route to25 km. Nominal 2*(20-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 150 us; changed 2*(25-5)*1000/2e8*1e6 = 200 us. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Plot transmission, round-trip propagation and equalization on one OLT timeline and verify aligned grant reference times.","Synthetic mean uptime3650 days and repair10 days; a spare-parts scenario reduces repair to4 days, not an operator commitment. Nominal 10/(3650+10) = 0.00273224 fraction; changed 4/(3650+4) = 0.00109469 fraction. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Build100 identical synthetic cycles and divide total downtime by total time; clarify whether the chosen MTBF convention includes repair.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-63f053269be6eab5","url":"https://www.itu.int/rec/T-REC-G.9807.1/en","title":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","titleEn":"ITU-T G.9807.1: XGS-PON","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-c3d81ddcbb39f738","url":"https://www.bw-digital.com/projects/hawaiki/","title":"Hawaiki network and marine maintenance","titleEn":"Hawaiki network and marine maintenance","publisher":"BW Digital","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
